\text{ hours}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 6: Add up all the times\n\n$$\n\\text{Total time} = \\text{Time}_1 + \\text{Rest time} + \\text{Time}_2 = 6 + 3 + 8 = \\boxed{17} \\text{ hours}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{17} \\text{ hours}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 5.9977115001529455, "draft_calls": 90, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 115, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "251af10860f50b1df17996075243f8bfc00f54754a80a263a430145cc8bcb294", "method": "relay_mlp4096_n2048", "output_hash": "3dc213ce4219e8c800729b7bbf2500a9c1965d65290a41ca91b75b9da5a2aa57", "output_tokens": 465, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 32316744704, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 32518438912, "problem_id": "gsm8k/fb9167f06dd28b30", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 1525.5849240422249, "prefill_full_target": 54.51740646362305, "prefill_relay": 0.49622398614883423, "relay": 37.00195184350014, "unattributed_runtime": 72.62732835114002, "verification_full_target": 4307.483665466309}, "proposal_lengths": [7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7, 7], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "17", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 5.9977115001529455, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 32518438912, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 32516341760, "target_calls": 90, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.0, "turn_index": 0, "verify_count": 90}
